- daemon: systemd unit for running without Docker
- Dockerfile: multi-arch (linux/amd64, linux/arm64), non-root, /data volume;
  build locally with docker buildx
- versioning: uv version --bump + git tags vX.Y.Z, CHANGELOG
- README: Docker usage
- more notification channels via Apprise (Telegram, ntfy, …) instead of Gmail-only
- email template (optional HTML with listing image)
- multiple shops
